# The build context of every image is the repository root (`docker/*.Dockerfile`, `compose.yaml`).
# What a working copy grows locally must not reach an image: `COPY apps/web ./` would otherwise
# copy the host's `node_modules` (built for another OS) over the one installed in the image, and a
# `.env` holding a provider key would be sent to the builder.
.git
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.next
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.env
**/.env.local
